WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.270
- All right y'all I
can't close out the show

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:05.020
without serving up one more
thing to make you go, "Aww."

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:06.320
This is "What I'm Liking."

00:00:07.748 --> 00:00:09.180
(audience applauding)

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:10.900
Okay, so we all know breakups suck,

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.260
but 22-year-old Kenzie from San Francisco

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:16.300
has discovered the perfect
cure, all thanks to her dad.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.579
Just check out this TikTok post.

00:00:18.579 --> 00:00:21.162
(gentle music)

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:30.180
As genuinely sweet as the video is,

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:31.280
the comments are even better.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:34.270
One person wrote, "Striving
to be as good as this dad

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:35.410
when I have kids."

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:38.140
Another one said, "He's
showing you the type of man

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:39.960
that you should settle for."

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:41.440
Well first of all don't settle.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:44.120
That wasn't the word you
maybe should have used,

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:45.450
but we have...

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:46.283
Just my thoughts.

00:00:46.283 --> 00:00:48.753
We have Kenzie on the line
right now, what's up Kenzie?

00:00:49.704 --> 00:00:50.537
(audience applauding)

00:00:50.537 --> 00:00:52.770
- Hi Kelly, so nice to meet you.

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:56.120
- I love your hair, it's
shorter now, that's so cute.

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:58.070
Your dad seems amazing.

00:00:58.070 --> 00:00:59.480
Is this like a tradition,

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:01.940
that if you ever have a breakup
he takes you to Disneyland.

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:04.030
It's a beautiful thing.

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:04.863
- [Kenzie] Well I don't know

00:01:04.863 --> 00:01:06.590
if it was supposed to be a tradition,

00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:09.393
but I'm definitely going
to make it a tradition now.

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:12.260
- So what have you learned from the video

00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:13.093
going viral though?

00:01:13.093 --> 00:01:15.090
Do you realize how lucky you
are to have a dad like that,

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:16.360
that's so cool.

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:17.193
- Yeah.

00:01:17.193 --> 00:01:22.193
So basically I had this Minnie
Mouse doll when I was little,

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:24.560
and my parents passed it down to me

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:26.070
from a daughter they had before me

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:27.350
who died when she was a baby.

00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:29.070
And so I was never able to meet my sister,

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:31.960
and I felt that this Minnie
Mouse was the only connection

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:32.970
I was gonna ever have to her.

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:35.670
So I just became obsessed
with Minnie Mouse

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:36.760
and all things Disneyland.

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:39.550
So Disneyland is just like a
really, really special place

00:01:39.550 --> 00:01:42.084
for me and my whole
family because of that.

00:01:42.084 --> 00:01:42.917
- Wow.

00:01:42.917 --> 00:01:46.497
- And so my first breakup in
high school my dad was like,

00:01:46.497 --> 00:01:47.620
"I need to cheer her up."

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:49.970
And so he took me to the
happiest place on earth

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:52.420
and it worked like a charm.

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:55.220
Come my second big breakup in college,

00:01:55.220 --> 00:01:59.020
he knew exactly what to do
this time, he'd learned.

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:01.470
And he took me to
Disneyland again this time.

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:03.040
My mom came along as well

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:06.170
and we all just experience
the magic together.

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:07.500
- Aw that's so sweet.

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:08.560
I love your family.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:11.010
And that's a beautiful full circle moment

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:12.900
with the Minnie Mouse thing
and tying you with Disneyland.

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:14.920
That's a beautiful thing that
your family will have forever.

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:17.198
Thank you so much for sharing with us.

00:02:17.198 --> 00:02:18.629
(audience applauding)

00:02:18.629 --> 00:02:19.462
- Of course.

00:02:19.462 --> 00:02:20.953
- All right, I'm liking your post girl.

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:22.983
And that's not all,

00:02:22.983 --> 00:02:25.350
our season partner Pilot
Pin makers of Friction,

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:27.830
