creating fearlessly

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:31.230
and just being rad in general,

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:32.820
so they're gonna give you $1000,

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:33.996
how's that sound?

00:02:33.996 --> 00:02:35.819
(audience applauding)

00:02:35.819 --> 00:02:36.652
- What?

00:02:36.652 --> 00:02:38.366
(audience applauding)
(Kelly laughing)

00:02:38.366 --> 00:02:40.187
My God, that's like (indistinct) awesome.

00:02:40.187 --> 00:02:43.340
- You got lots of trips
to Disneyland on that.

